                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="col-12 col-md-6" style="padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0;">
                        <div class="info-item" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
                          <div class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-center">
